OL,3,GNEWSAMan given 15-year ban on owning
OL,4,Aanimals after training dog for fights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been given a 15-year ban on
OL,7,Fowning animals after training a dog for
OL,8,Fanimal fighting.
OL,10,FSean Alexander Mullen's Patterdale
OL,11,Fterrier, called Ronnie, was found with
OL,12,Fserious facial injuries by the Scottish
OL,13,FSPCA.
OL,15,FMullen, who had 11 previous convictions
OL,16,Fincluding one for bludgeoning a fox to
OL,17,Fdeath, was given the ban on caring for,
OL,18,Fand owning, animals and was ordered to
OL,19,Fcarry out 200 hours of unpaid work.
OL,21,FRonnie has since been rehomed.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
